# Mercor

> Mercor connects experts with frontier AI labs to train and evaluate
> models. We publish the APEX benchmarks, which measure AI performance
> on real professional work in software engineering, accounting,
> law, medicine, finance and consulting.

## Benchmarks
- [APEX](https://www.mercor.com/apex/): the AI Productivity Index, our benchmark suite
- [APEX-SWE](https://www.mercor.com/apex/apex-swe-leaderboard/): software engineering leaderboard
- [APEX-Agents](https://www.mercor.com/apex/apex-agents-leaderboard/): agentic professional work leaderboard
- [APEX-Accounting](https://www.mercor.com/apex/apex-accounting-leaderboard/): accounting leaderboard, built with Ramp
- [APEX v1](https://www.mercor.com/apex/apex-v1-leaderboard/): original leaderboard across four professions
- [Off-the-shelf data](https://www.mercor.com/apex/off-the-shelf-data/): pre-built datasets

